OL,3,GNEWSACafe owner frustrated by council's
OL,4,Apavement rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cafe owner has spoken of his
OL,7,Ffrustration after being told he must
OL,8,Fpay nearly #800 to retain an outdoor
OL,9,Fseating area at the front of the
OL,10,Fpremises.
OL,12,FAdam Heyes said he applied to renew his
OL,13,Fpavement licence for Mandala, in
OL,14,FChesterfield Road, Sheffield, but was
OL,15,Ftold he would also need planning
OL,16,Fpermission to keep the tables, chairs
OL,17,Fand surrounding planters.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
