OL,3,GNEWSACafe owner frustrated by council's
OL,4,Apavement rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said he had been quoted #610, with
OL,7,Fan additional #189 pre-application
OL,8,Fadvice fee, and told the BBC: "This
OL,9,Fjust seems unnecessary for such a
OL,10,Fsimple thing."
OL,12,FSheffield City Council said licensing
OL,13,Fofficers were working with Heyes to
OL,14,Ffind a solution.
